AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:add") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:0781765196") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16362985") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PRO:ADD") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000050159> "An IgA immunoglobulin complex, circulating in human that is composed of (in monomeric form) two identical immunoglobulin heavy chains of the secretory isoform of the IgA1 isotype and two identical immunoglobulin light chains (kappa or lambda), held together by disulfide bonds, sometimes complexed with J chain or J chain and secretory component, and present in the extracellular space, in mucosal areas or other tissues, or circulating in the blood or lymph.")
